OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ANew Strictly hosts explain their roles
OL,4,Aas they reject 'roving presenter'
OL,5,Areports
OL,6,
OL,7,FEmma Willis, Josh Widdicombe and
OL,8,FJohannes Radebe have said they will not
OL,9,Fhave "fixed roles" on Strictly Come
OL,10,FDancing, as they prepare to replace
OL,11,FTess Daly and Claudia Winkleman later
OL,12,Fthis month.
OL,14,FDaly and Winkleman left the programme
OL,15,Ftogether at the end of the 2025 series.
OL,17,FDaly was the host on the dancefloor,
OL,18,Fintroducing the dancers and judges,
OL,19,Fwhile Winkleman did the post-dance
OL,20,Fdebrief upstairs in the "Clauditorium".
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,166,160,200,105,0,100
